The Home Assistant integration calculates stored tank energy itself for accuracy and internal consistency. dashboard.solesta.nl calculates kWh directly as 0.00116 × tank volume × temperature difference and uses 1.20582 kWh per standard shower. The integration first calculates MJ with 4.186 kJ/(kg·°C), converts that result using MJ / 3.6, and calculates energy per standard shower from 5 minutes × 8 litres/minute × (38 °C − cold-water temperature) × 4.186 / 3600.

